--                       Ωⁿ⁺¹(∥Sⁿ⁺¹∥₍₃₊ₙ₎) ≃ ℤ.  The first stratum above
--                       the last silent one already carries every winding
--                       number.  THERE IS NO STRATUM OF PARTIAL SPEECH.
--
-- So the corpus does not merely have the tower; it has the tower's GRADING,
